---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container inner">
    <div>
      <strong class="brand">K2SO</strong>
      <p>Gemelo digital forense para redes LoRaWAN · Prueba de concepto (TFG).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="right mono">
      <a href="https://github.com/blasmoyano/dt-lorawan-forensic-landing" id="footer-github" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
      <a href="#inicio" id="footer-top">Volver arriba ↑</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container legal mono">© {year} · Una anomalía es un indicio, no una confirmación de ataque.</div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 3rem 0 2rem; background: rgba(5, 8, 15, 0.6); }
  .inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; }
  .brand { font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0.4rem 0 0; }
  .right { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .legal { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); opacity: 0.7; }
</style>
